          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When Jesus finished telling these parables, he left that place ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and went back to his home town. He taught in the synagogue, and those who heard him were amazed. “Where did he get such wisdom?” they asked. “And what about his miracles? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isn't he the carpenter's son? Isn't Mary his mother, and aren't James, Joseph, Simon, and Judas his brothers? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aren't all his sisters living here? Where did he get all this?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 13:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.4.44"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jn 4.44",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And so they rejected him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.13.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.13.57"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
